  "term": "experiential learning",
  "definition": "Experiential learning is a way of learning in which people gain knowledge through direct, practical experience alongside theory. It emphasizes reflecting on experience, forming new understanding from it, and applying that understanding in ways that can build skills, attitudes, and behavior change.",
